	<TextRow
		Label="msg_hyouka_i03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あちこちにいる　トレーナーも
さまざまな　ポケモンを　もっているわ▼
かれらと　しょうぶすることで
ポケモンずかんも　うまっていくわね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:31:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あちこちにいる　トレーナーも
さまざまな　ポケモンを　持っているわ▼
彼らと　勝負することで
ポケモン図鑑も　埋まっていくわね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:31:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>図鑑評価：イッシュ図鑑
・みた数が
　45～64匹</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:17:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>アララギ博士：娘</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_hyouka_i04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きまった　ほらあなにしか　いない
ポケモンも　いるのよ！▼
とおりぬけた　ほらあなを
もういちど　さがすのも　いいかもね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:31:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>決まった　洞穴にしか　いない
ポケモンも　いるのよ！▼
通り抜けた　洞穴を
もう一度　探すのも　いいかもね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:31:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>図鑑評価：イッシュ図鑑
・みた数が
　65～84匹</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:17:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>アララギ博士：娘</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_hyouka_i05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>だいぶ　ページが　うまってきたわね▼
ポケモンずかんを　みかえせば
たびの　おもいでも　よみがえるかも！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>だいぶ　ページが　埋まってきたわね▼
ポケモン図鑑を　見返せば
旅の　記憶も　よみがえるかも！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>図鑑評価：イッシュ図鑑
・みた数が
　85～104匹</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:17:23" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
