			<Comment>図鑑評価：イッシュ図鑑
・みた数が
　105～124匹</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:17:38" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>アララギ博士：娘</Text>
