			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>図鑑評価：イッシュ図鑑
・みた数が
　205～224匹</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:19:48" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>アララギ博士：娘</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:16:03" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_hyouka_i12"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>だいぶ　りっぱな　ポケモンずかんね！
あとひといきで　ページが　うまりそう▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:31:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:18:19" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>だいぶ　立派な　ポケモン図鑑ね！
あとひといきで　ページが　埋まりそう▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:31:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:18:19" />
		</LanguageCell>
