				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:19:36" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>アララギ博士：娘</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:16:03" />
		</AttributeCell>
