			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_hyouka_i13"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>すばらしい　ポケモンずかんね！
もうすこしで　かんせい　しそう！▼
おねがいして　ほんとうに　よかった！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:19:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:18:19" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>すばらしい　ポケモン図鑑ね！
もうすこしで　完成しそう！▼
お願いして　本当に　よかった！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:19:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:18:19" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>図鑑評価：イッシュ図鑑
・みた数が
　240～249匹</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:19:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>アララギ博士：娘</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:16:03" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_hyouka_i14"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>すごい！　すごいわ！▼
イッシュちほうにいる　すべての
ポケモンと　であったのね！▼
ほんとうに　おめでとう！！▼
じゃあ　つぎからは
イッシュちほうの　ポケモンを▽
どれだけ　つかまえたか▽
ひょうか　していくわね！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:16:08" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:16:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>すごい！　すごいわ！▼
イッシュ地方にいる　すべての
ポケモンと　出会ったのね！▼
本当に　おめでとう！！▼
じゃあ　次からは
イッシュ地方の　ポケモンを▽
どれだけ　捕まえたか▽
評価していくわね！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:16:08" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:16:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>図鑑評価：イッシュ図鑑
・みた数が
　250匹</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:16:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>アララギ博士：娘</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:16:03" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_hyouka_i15"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>すこしずつ……　だけど　かくじつに
ポケモンずかんに　くわしい　データが▽
かきこまれているわね！　がんばって！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:21:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:21:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>すこしずつ……　だけど　確実に
ポケモン図鑑に　詳しいデータが▽
書き込まれているわね！　がんばって！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:21:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:21:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>図鑑評価：イッシュ図鑑
・捕まえた数が
　0～14匹</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:22:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>アララギ博士：娘</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:21:22" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#00ff00</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_hyouka_i16"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>モンスターボールは　つかいわけてる？▼
さまざまな　しゅるいが　あるから
じょうきょうに　おうじて　つかってね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:21:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:21:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>モンスターボールは　使い分けてる？▼
さまざまな　種類が　あるから
状況に　応じて　使ってね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:21:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:21:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>図鑑評価：イッシュ図鑑
・捕まえた数が
