			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:21:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>季節に　よっては
出会いにくい　ポケモン▽
出会いやすい　ポケモンも　いるわ！▼</Text>
