				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T07:34:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T06:23:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>これだけの　多くの　ポケモンを
調べても　彼らの　起源……▼
いつ　どこで　生まれたのか
わからないこと　ばかり　なのよね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-03T07:34:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
