		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_hyouka_hakase2_08"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>めざめるパワーは　おぼえる
ポケモンに　よって　タイプや▽
いりょくが　かわる　わざ　なの！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>めざめるパワーは　覚える
ポケモンに　よって　タイプや▽
威力が　変わる　技なの！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>図鑑評価後
・No344「まもる」入手後
・続けてhakase2_09</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</CommentCell>
